        "node_id": "n_2_6d74db",
        "thought_text": "Instead of checking each number individually up to n, we can use dynamic programming to count special numbers more efficiently. This approach will significantly reduce the time complexity and avoid the Time Limit Exceeded error.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_2_6d74db_0",
        "feedback_id": "fb_9aaa72a931",
        "created_at": 1794535147.576019
      },
      "rev_n_3_99ca5f_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_99ca5f_1",
        "node_id": "n_3_99ca5f",
        "thought_text": "The current approach is inefficient and incorrect for large inputs. Instead, we should use dynamic programming to count the number of special numbers directly, avoiding the need for recursive calls and memoization. This will significantly improve the time complexity and correctness for large inputs.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
        "replaces_revision_id": "rev_n_3_99ca5f_0",
